cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Reclami: customer complaints, defect statistics and quality index (first version) (db, 1998–2000)"
version: "1.0"
abstract: "This is the first complaint-management system of a plastic-film manufacturer, a database application written before the later program Reclami. Complaints are linked to the orders, shipments, customers and products imported from the company AS/400; for each complaint the quality office records defect, family, production line and external processing, the solution (accepted or rejected), the returned kilograms and the credit note, and marks when it has been passed to the accounts department. A large set of queries and reports produces monthly quality indices, defect and supplier charts and statistics by customer, order, product, family and sales network."
authors:
